@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@providerId = 1
@clientId = 2
@serviceId = 1
@requestId = 1
@reviewId = 1
### Diagnóstico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello
### Criar provider
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.prestadora@example.com",
  "password": "SenhaDemo123",
  "role": "PROVIDER",
  "active": true
}
### Criar client
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "João Souza",
  "email": "joao.cliente@example.com",
  "password": "SenhaDemo123",
  "role": "CLIENT",
  "active": true
}
### Criar service
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manutenção de computador",
  "description": "Limpeza e diagnóstico",
  "price": 150,
  "category": "TECNOLOGIA",
  "providerId": {{providerId}},
  "active": true
}
### Criar request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "clientId": {{clientId}},
  "status": "PENDING",
  "notes": "Computador não liga"
}
### Avançar pedido para ACCEPTED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "ACCEPTED"}
### Avançar pedido para IN_PROGRESS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "IN_PROGRESS"}
### Avançar pedido para COMPLETED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "COMPLETED"}
### Avaliar pedido concluído
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": {{requestId}},
  "reviewerId": {{clientId}},
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Atendimento concluído"
}
### Filtrar e paginar ofertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services?category=TECNOLOGIA&minPrice=100&maxPrice=200&page=0&size=5&sort=price,asc
### Consultar avaliações
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/{{serviceId}}/reviews
### Consultar pedidos do cliente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{clientId}}/service-requests
### Excluir registro da demonstração
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/{{reviewId}}
### Excluir registro da demonstração
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-requests/{{requestId}}
### Excluir registro da demonstração
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/{{serviceId}}
### Excluir registro da demonstração
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{clientId}}
### Excluir registro da demonstração
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{providerId}}
